---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Mike Hnath">

  <div class="section">
    <div class="page-title">About</div>
    <div class="body-text">Most people in marketing came up through internships and agency ladders...<strong>I came up through a van and trailer.</strong></div>
    <div class="body-text">At 17, I started my first band and never looked back. By my mid-20s I was managing international tours across 22 countries, negotiating multiple distribution deals, and figuring out how to sell over $150K in merch out of a trailer. Nobody gave me a playbook. I just had to figure it out (logistics, budgets, branding, audience growth, all of it) in real time.</div>
    <div class="body-text">That instinct (figure it out and ship it) carried me through Kraft Heinz, Disney, and 10+ years of building brands for founders through my consultancy, THIS. The details are in the work.</div>
    <div class="body-text">Outside of work, I'm usually at the gym, at the beach, or racking up a game of pool. I love creating media of all kinds (music, video, design, anything I can make with my hands or a screen) and I'm at my best when I'm around people. Connecticut's shoreline is home base, and I try not to take that for granted.</div>

    <div class="section-label" style="margin-top:40px">Personal updates</div>
    <div id="about-updates"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">Contact</div>
    <div class="contact-row">
      <div class="contact-row-left">
        <div class="contact-row-label">Local time</div>
        <div class="local-time-big" id="about-time">--:-- --</div>
        <div class="local-time-sub">Connecticut, USA (ET)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-row">
      <div class="contact-row-left">
        <div class="contact-row-label">Email</div>
        <div class="contact-row-title">Open to a conversation</div>
        <div class="contact-row-sub">Brand strategy and growth work. Retainers and scoped projects. Anchor client is in cannabis, so regulated categories are fair game.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-row-right">
        <a class="action-btn" href="mailto:me@mikehnath.com">Compose</a>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="copyEmail(event)">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-row">
      <div class="contact-row-left">
        <div class="contact-row-label">Stay in touch</div>
        <div class="contact-row-title">Most responsive on LinkedIn</div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-row-right">
        <div class="social-pills">
          <a class="social-pill" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mikehnath/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/Icons/linkedin.svg" style="width:16px;height:16px;display:block" />LinkedIn</a>
          <a class="social-pill" href="https://github.com/MikeHnath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/Icons/github.svg" style="width:16px;height:16px;display:block" />GitHub</a>
          <a class="social-pill" href="https://hnath.myportfolio.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/Icons/adobe-portfolio.svg" style="width:16px;height:16px;display:block" />Portfolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</Base>
